        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo Custom 9 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Commercial Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis 9\" Center to Center (CTC)  commercial door pull is made from 3/4\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/10-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-20\"><b>10\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/12-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-21\"><b>12\" Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/18-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-22\"><b>18\" Door Pull</b></a> and other style <a href=\"/collections/don-jo-door-pulls\"><b>Don-Jo Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo Custom 9\" Commercial Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thru-Bolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>",
